        "##Chart Redesign:\n",
        "##1b) The original pie chart was replaced with a horizontal bar chart to accurately represent the distribution of math scores while minimizing cognitive load. Aligned with Gestalt principles, the design employs a sequential color gradient taht transitions from dark-to-light to intuitively map data values from highest to lowest percentages."
